    "Name": "Grand Titan T-IT-N20C",
    "Details": "The Grand Titan T-IT-N20C is a major refit performed at <i>Calloway VI</i> that replaces virtually everything except the bones with Clan equivalents. As a result it mounts two capacitor-enhanced Snub-Nose PPCs for a powerful knockout punch at close range, and its Supercharger helps it get there. The 'Mech's pilots also value the slight range advantage of the Clan weapons, using it to lure in enemies expecting the performance of the standard T-IT-N10M.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>",
